The standalone checkpoint contains frozen visual patch-projection tensors,
interpolated position tensors, and fixed-prompt embeddings originating from
Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct, developed by the Qwen Team at Alibaba Cloud.
The patch and position processing is adapted for the LightGen2 reference model.

